\item[S2] Dohoon Choi and Youngmin Lee, \emph{Newman\textquotesingle s conjecture for the partition function modulo integers with at least two distinct prime divisors}, arXiv:2212.00636v2 (2025), Section 1, Conjecture 1.1. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/2212.00636}.
